{"unit_id":"WayneJin0918__dsh-wm#feature-1","repo":"WayneJin0918/dsh-wm","commit":"cd06866a638b1dcc80defa6d674ff3470ff0ad31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wm 的功能「运行目录发现」：读取 wm.yaml 或按目录名称猜测预测帧、真值帧、日志、指标和动作文件，并返回帧数与缺失项提示。通过 wm_discover 工具或 discover 命令触发，输入运行目录路径，产出布局摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:40-62","lib/discover.js:70-140"]}
{"unit_id":"WayneJin0918__dsh-wm#feature-2","repo":"WayneJin0918/dsh-wm","commit":"cd06866a638b1dcc80defa6d674ff3470ff0ad31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wm 的功能「预测帧评分」：将预测帧与真值帧配对，计算逐帧亮度 SSIM 和 MSE，返回整体分数、变化曲线和最差帧。通过 wm_rollout_diff 工具或 diff 命令触发，输入两组图像路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:64-83","lib/diff.js:20-55"]}
{"unit_id":"WayneJin0918__dsh-wm#feature-3","repo":"WayneJin0918/dsh-wm","commit":"cd06866a638b1dcc80defa6d674ff3470ff0ad31","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wm 的功能「交互式对比页」：生成可本地打开的 HTML 页面，提供并排、滑动叠加和差异热图视图、SSIM 时间线及动作 HUD。通过 wm_view 工具或 view 命令触发，输入运行目录或预测路径和可选真值路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:121-151","lib/view.js:1-20"]}
